OL,3,GNEWSAJailed nursery worker charged with
OL,4,Afraud offence
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former nursery worker who was jailed
OL,7,Ffor downloading thousands of indecent
OL,8,Fimages has been charged with fraud
OL,9,Fafter he took another job with children
OL,10,Ffollowing his arrest.
OL,12,FKristian Parry, of Middleton in Leeds,
OL,13,Fwas jailed for two years in March
OL,14,Fhaving admitted making more than 5,000
OL,15,Findecent images of young children.
OL,17,FThe BBC discovered Parry started a job
OL,18,Fat another nursery in Leeds while he
OL,19,Fwas on bail and under investigation for
OL,20,Fpossessing indecent images of children.
OL,21,FThe images did not involve children in
OL,22,Fhis care.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
