OL,3,GNEWSAJailed nursery worker charged with
OL,4,Afraud offence
OL,5,
OL,6,FParry, 27, has now been charged with
OL,7,Fcommitting fraud by false
OL,8,Frepresentation in June 2025 and is due
OL,9,Fto appear at Leeds Magistrates' Court
OL,10,Fon 2 October.
